    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "OUR CONSTRUCTION PROCESS"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "YOUR DREAM. OUR PRIORITY."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "THAT'S LEGENDARY."
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "1. Land / Lot Acquisition"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Legendary, we service clients on existing and new lots of land. We're happy to construct your dream home on your private lot, or have relationships with local real estate professionals to assist in finding the perfect lot to fit your family's needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "2. Layout & Design"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Details are what separate are ordinary home from a Legendary home. We work closely with local talented architects to ensure the layout of your space meets the needs and requirements of your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "3. Selections & Budget"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Our in-house design team collaborates throughout the design phase, ensuring we create a custom home that is aligned with your specifications. Transparency is key, and we'll provide exceptional communication, ensuring we stay within your desired budget to ensure there are no surprise costs."
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "4. Construction"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Details are what separate are ordinary home from a Legendary home. We work closely with local talented architects to ensure the layout of your space meets the needs and requirements of your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "5. Service beyond completion"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We pride ourselves in the level of service and communication we provide our customers, not only during the construction phase but for years to come. We provide a 1-year full coverage warranty, and a 5-year structural and foundation warranty."
    },
